<mujoco model="fr3_inspirehand">
  <!-- Standalone MuJoCo model of an Inspire RH56 right hand mounted on an FR3.

       All mesh paths are relative to this file and stay inside this asset
       bundle. fr3_link8 is the flange frame, 107 mm beyond fr3_link7. The
       hand_mount body applies a -pi/2 yaw which, composed with the hand's
       existing base-link rotation, matches forgeUltra franka-chi's zero-offset
       flange-to-palm quaternion (0.5, -0.5, -0.5, 0.5), in wxyz order. -->

